# fib_braid_s2 — Fibonacci anyon braid 생성원 σ₂ = F·R·F. Tier-0 2×2. TrackGate6 G5c (#TOPO).
# F = [[φ⁻¹, φ^{−½}], [φ^{−½}, −φ⁻¹]] (fusion 재결합, F²=I·F=F†) · R = diag(e^{−4πi/5}, e^{3πi/5}).
#   ★F = ry_fib·z_gate (수치 exact) → plan = [z, ry_fib]·z5⁷·[z, ry_fib] (11스텝, up-to-phase C4).
#   Euler 대조(설계 검증): σ₂ = e^{−iπ/10}·Rz(−7π/5)·Ry(2arccos φ⁻¹)·Rz(−2π/5) exact.
# golden=F·R·F 정의 직접(위상 포함). ★Yang-Baxter σ₁σ₂σ₁==σ₂σ₁σ₂ · B₃ 중심 (σ₁σ₂)³=e^{2πi/5}I ·
#   비-Clifford(Clifford-24 overlap 0.97<1) = fib_braid_observe(INV-Q3, seal 아님).
# 정직 경계: 봉인=생성원 유니터리뿐. universality·근사 컴파일·n-anyon 일반화=범위 밖.
