```python id=app_golden
import numpy as np
phi = (1.0 + np.sqrt(5.0)) / 2.0
R = np.diag([np.exp(-4j * np.pi / 5), np.exp(3j * np.pi / 5)]).astype(complex)
F = np.array([[1/phi, 1/np.sqrt(phi)], [1/np.sqrt(phi), -1/phi]], dtype=complex)
golden = F @ R @ F
```
